      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Now the same overlap logic:\n\nBoth = 25 + 16 − 38 = 3\n\nWith a 'neither' group, subtract it from the total FIRST, then find the overlap.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
